# Agent runtime image: start closed and reopen only reviewed build inputs.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!aegra.json

!agent/
agent/**
!agent/pyproject.toml
!agent/bm25-policy.toml
!agent/corpus-policy.toml
!agent/src/
!agent/src/**
!agent/skills/
!agent/skills/**

# uv must see every workspace member manifest, but no evaluation source or results.
!eval/
eval/**
!eval/pyproject.toml

!scripts/
scripts/**
!scripts/build_index.py

# The runtime corpus is Markdown-only. Media and unrelated repository files stay out.
!content/
content/**
!content/**/*.md

# Terminal sensitive/generated denies override every exception above.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.netrc
**/.git-credentials
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
**/.index
**/.index/**
**/.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.py[cod]
**/artifacts
**/artifacts/**
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.ppk
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*.der
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*credentials*.json
**/gha-creds-*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*service_account*.json
**/application_default_credentials.json
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.*
**/.terraform
**/.terraform/**
**/.aws
**/.aws/**
**/.config/gcloud
**/.config/gcloud/**
**/.ssh
**/.ssh/**
**/id_rsa
**/id_dsa
**/id_ecdsa
**/id_ed25519
**/ssh_host_*_key
**/.docker/config.json
**/.kube/config
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/.next
**/.next/**
**/coverage
**/coverage/**
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/htmlcov/**
